<title>UK: Northern's Haskins to probe UK regulation.</title>
<headline>Northern's Haskins to probe UK regulation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The government said on Thursday it had appointed Christopher Haskins, chairman of Northern Foods Plc, to chair a Better Regulation Task Force.</p>
<p>David Clark, the cabinet minister responsible for the machinery of government, said in a parliamentary written answer that the Task Force would advise the government on action to improve its effectiveness and credibility ahead of a policy White Paper to be published later this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Our aim is to ensure that regulations are simple, helpful and fair for business and the citizen,&quot; Clark said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427767</p>
